## ==============================================================================
## .NET / C# / Avalonia 官方标准 .gitignore 忽略规则
## ==============================================================================

# 1. 编译与打包输出产物 (Build & Publish Output)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
dist/
publish/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# 2. Visual Studio / JetBrains Rider 临时与用户缓存
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.launchSettings.json.user

# 3. VS Code 个人工作区配置
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# 4. 运行时崩溃日志与测试结果 (Test & Crash Dumps)
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.dmp
*.crash

# 5. NuGet 包缓存
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
packages/
!packages/build/

# 6. 临时文件与自动备份
*.tmp
*.temp
*~
todos.json.tmp
todos.json.corrupted.*

# 7. 操作系统特有冗余文件 (macOS / Windows / Linux)
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
